# windOS Zen — LXQt edition package list (Debian 13 Trixie)
# Installed when the user picks "LXQt Edition" in Calamares.
# All names verified against Trixie: lxqt-core pulls the Qt5 desktop,
# openbox is its WM, qterminal the terminal. No neofetch/conky here —
# neither ships the package those names imply on Trixie.
lxqt-core
openbox
qterminal
arc-theme
papirus-icon-theme
